# The Secret Service for linuxArm64 and linuxX64 (ADR 0127's Consequences): libsecret reached by
# dlopen through veyq_secret.h's helpers alone, so nothing of libsecret or glib is linked or included; the header and
# its directory are handed in by core/build.gradle.kts. dlopen and dlsym are libdl's in Kotlin/Native's sysroot (glibc
# 2.19 / 2.25, before 2.34 moved them into libc); Kotlin/Native links -ldl already, named here so the need is written.
package = me.raddatz.veyq.mobile.secret
headers = veyq_secret.h
headerFilter = veyq_secret.h
linkerOpts = -ldl
